
# Raspberry Pi Predator Camera Notes

**Last Updated:** 9 October 2026

## Useful Navigation Commands

Show current location:

```bash
pwd
```

List files:

```bash
ls
```

List files with details:

```bash
ls -lah
```

Change directory:

```bash
cd ~/predator
```

Go up one directory:

```bash
cd ..
```

---

## Date and Time

Show date and time:

```bash
date
```

Show timezone:

```bash
timedatectl
```

Example output:

```text
Fri 09 Oct 2026 20:33:10 NZDT
```

