## Camera Tests

Take a photo:

```bash
rpicam-still -o test.jpg
```

Take a full-resolution photo:

```bash
rpicam-still --width 2592 --height 1944 -o fullres.jpg
```

Record a 10-second video:

```bash
rpicam-vid \
  --codec libav \
  -t 10000 \
  -o test.mp4
```

Record a 30-second video:

```bash
rpicam-vid \
  --codec libav \
  -t 30000 \
  -o test_30s.mp4
```

---

## Web Server

Start a web server:

```bash
cd ~/predator
python3 -m http.server 8080
```

View files:

```text
http://100.81.140.115:8080
```

Events:

```text
http://100.81.140.115:8080/events/
```

Videos:

```text
http://100.81.140.115:8080/videos/
```

Stop web server:

```bash
Ctrl+C
```

Run in background:

```bash
nohup python3 -m http.server 8080 > server.log 2>&1 &
```

