## Troubleshooting

Camera detected:

```bash
rpicam-still -o test.jpg
```

Check running processes:

```bash
ps aux
```

Find web server:

```bash
ps aux | grep http.server
```

Check port 8080:

```bash
ss -tlnp | grep 8080
```

